name lineno
category Package
revision 67171
shortdesc Line numbers on paragraphs
relocated 1
longdesc Adds line numbers to selected paragraphs with reference
longdesc possible through the LaTeX \ref and \pageref cross reference
longdesc mechanism. Line numbering may be extended to footnote lines,
longdesc using the fnlineno package.
runfiles size=59
